  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Curriculum development maritime sector, Cabo Verde</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to determine the best set-up and capacity building activities for a maritime training institute for Cabo Verde (island of S&#xe3;o Vicente), aiming to offer high-quality education and training programmes following the international standards on safe and efficient maritime operations.Also, this project will benefit the Cabo Verdian community through an education offer that fits the needs and will contribute to more and better jobs in the sector.</narrative>
  </description>
